  "ruleText": "Lab 303.14 “Reinstatement\" means the restoring or renewal of coverage by the same carrier without a lapse in coverage as confirmed by department records.\n\nSource. #4854, eff 6-29-90; ss by #5235, eff 9-27-91, EXPIRED: 9-27-97\n\nNew. #6631, INTERIM, eff 11-16-97, EXPIRED: 3-16-98\n\nNew. #6806, eff 7-18-98 (formerly Lab 303.12); ss by #8682, INTERIM, eff 7-15-06, EXPIRED: 1-11-07\n\nNew. #9019, eff 11-1-07; ss by #11065, eff 4-1-16 (from Lab 303.15)",
